      },
      {
        "text": "This increased economic insecurity is due to structural changes in the economy, not just temporary downturns.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "The Republican Party did a better job than ours at making people feel like they belong to its vision.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
