    "turn_text": "Well, I would say two things. We certainly have an obligation to stand up and oppose public policy that we believe is bad for the country, but I do agree that we can't just be the opposition. We need to endeavor to be the alternative, to offer ideas that speak to people, to take our principles of limited government and free enterprise, and apply them to the unique challenges of the 21st century. And on that front, I think we have room for improvement.",
