    "turn_text": "I did not campaign for U.S. military intervention. What I campaigned on behalf of and argued is that the U.S. should do more to assist the non-Jihadi rebels in Syria and to empower them, because in the absence of doing so, you created the opportunity for foreign fighters and jihadists to pour into Syria, which is exactly what has happened. For the better part of two years, that did not occur. And in fact, now Syria has become a safe haven for terrorist groups, including foreign fighters from Europe, to travel into Syria and use it as an operational space to organize and carry out attacks in Iraq and potentially in other regions, including in Europe",
